  "equation": "11",
  "raw_span": "\\|Q x_i^l + g - (Q x_j^l + g)\\|^2 = \\|Q(x_i^l - x_j^l)\\|^2 = \\|x_i^l - x_j^l\\|^2 \\quad (11)",
